{"id":"en_i-became-the-mind-reading-dragon-emperor-s-only-silence","title":"I Became the Mind-Reading Dragon Emperor's Only Silence","titleEn":"I Became the Mind-Reading Dragon Emperor's Only Silence","description":"After an accident, emergency doctor Lynn wakes in Aethergard, where the system AI-77 gives her a mission: take the Heartscale from Aurelius, the Dragon Emperor, if she wants to get back home. Aurelius hears the thoughts of everyone around him, yet Lynn is the one mind he cannot read. Being near her grants him quiet, and he is her sole route to escape. Everything shifts once Lynn learns that AI-77 intends to use the Heartscale to throw the world into chaos, leaving her torn between returning home and remaining with the emperor she has grown to love.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/i-became-the-mind-reading-dragon-emperors-only-silence/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/i-became-the-mind-reading-dragon-emperors-only-silence/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Adventure","Fantasy","Female","Supernatural","Transmigration","Dark Romance"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d7o8k/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_i-became-the-mind-reading-dragon-emperor-s-only-silence_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d7o8k/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-became-the-mind-reading-dragon-emperor-s-only-silence_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d7o8k/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-became-the-mind-reading-dragon-emperor-s-only-silence_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rum